silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_06_dependency_governance_sections_01_dependency_as_typed_arrow_concrete_anchor_1 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 01_dependency_as_typed_arrow #1', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'Dependency as Typed Arrow' the bare symbol VetRecord anchors to MeasurementSourceLeg: The positioned node: MeasurementLeg in its role as an input source leg into D_Mittens, the colimit diagram for Mittens. The leg connects the measurement evidence to the apex.." .
